    question: "Where do we start driving lessons in Bishopthorpe?", 
    answer: "We can start from your home in Bishopthorpe or a convenient local spot. Beginners often start in the quieter residential loops off Sim Balk Lane to build basic car control before moving onto busier village roads."
  },
  {
    question: "How do you help learners with the narrower roads in Bishopthorpe?",
