  },
  { 
    question: "Do you pick up from local offices or schools in Bishopthorpe?", 
    answer: "We're very flexible and can arrange pickups from your workplace, local school, or home in Bishopthorpe — including anywhere on Main Street or Sim Balk Lane — so your lessons fit into your day."
  },
  { 
    question: "Are evening or weekend driving lessons available in Bishopthorpe?", 
