  },
  { 
    question: "What if I'm particularly nervous about driving towards York city centre?", 
    answer: "Our instructors are known for their patient approach. We'll progress at your pace, staying on quieter Bishopthorpe roads until you're truly ready for busier routes like those in <a href='/driving-lessons-acomb-york' class='font-bold underline'>Acomb</a> or the city centre." 
  },
  { 
    question: "How can I book an assessment lesson in Bishopthorpe?", 
    answer: "Simply fill out our online enquiry form. We’ll discuss your goals and match you with a local instructor covering Sim Balk Lane, Bishopthorpe Road, and the surrounding YO23 area."
  }
];

